### Variables (Replace with the UUID printed in your console on startup)
@tutorId = REPLACE_WITH_TUTOR_UUID_FROM_CONSOLE
@slotId = REPLACE_WITH_SLOT_UUID_FROM_CREATION

### 1. Create a new slot (201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/slots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tutorId": "{{tutorId}}",
  "startTime": "2026-12-01T10:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-12-01T12:00:00Z"
}

### 2. Validation Error - End time before start time (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/slots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tutorId": "{{tutorId}}",
  "startTime": "2026-12-01T14:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-12-01T13:00:00Z"
}

### 3. Overlap Error - Same time (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/slots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tutorId": "{{tutorId}}",
  "startTime": "2026-12-01T10:30:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-12-01T11:30:00Z"
}

### 4. Get all slots for a tutor (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/slots/tutor/{{tutorId}}

### 5. Get a specific slot (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/slots/{{slotId}}

### 6. Update a slot (200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/slots/{{slotId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startTime": "2026-12-01T14:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-12-01T16:00:00Z"
}

### 7. Delete a slot (204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/slots/{{slotId}}

### 8. Not Found Error (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/slots/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000